# Reference voices are never committed (see voices/README.md).
voices/*
!voices/README.md
# Render products and caches
out/
cache/
# inbox/: ad JSONs are committed so a push renders them in CI
# (.github/workflows/radio_ads.yml); anything else dropped there stays local.
inbox/*
!inbox/*.json
!inbox/README.md
failed/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.part
